Usage:   sqlr skill
Version: *    

Description:

  Print instructions for AI agents. Use --init to create a skill (/sqlr)

Options:

  -h, --help            - Show this help.                                                                       
  --debug               - Enable debug logs                                                                     
  -g, --global          - Use global scope for connections (ignore git repository scope)                        
  --init                - Create the skill in the current git repository, or in the home directory outside one  
  -n, --name    <name>  - Pin the created skill to a connection (creates /sqlr-<name>)                          

